<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Notice of Upcoming Lease Expiration</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 20px; max-width: 600px;">
    <div style="background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px;">
        <h2 style="color: #ff5733; text-align: center;">Notice of Upcoming Lease Expiration</h2>
        <p>Dear <strong>{{receiver}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>We are writing to inform you that your lease agreement, which began on <strong>{{startDate}}</strong>, will expire on <strong>{{endDate}}</strong>.</p>
        
        <p>To ensure continuity and convenience for renewal, if you wish to extend your lease, please complete the renewal process at least one week before the expiration date. This will allow us to prepare the best arrangements for your continued stay.</p>
        
        <h3 style="color: #333;">Current Lease Information:</h3>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
            <li><strong>Property Address:</strong> {{location}}</li>
            <li><strong>Monthly Rent:</strong> {{price}}/month</li>
            <li><strong>Lease Start Date:</strong> {{startDate}}</li>
            <li><strong>Lease End Date:</strong> {{endDate}}</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px;">
            <a href={{url}} style="background-color: #28a745; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; width: 45%; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none;">Renew Lease</a>
            <a href={{url}} style="background-color: #dc3545; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; width: 45%; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none;">Confirm Lease Termination</a>
        </div>
        
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888888; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
            Best regards,<br>
            <strong>Landlord</strong>
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
